==English==
{{wp|bite (disambiguation)}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*bʰeyd-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|biten}}, from {{inh|en|ang|bītan||bite}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*bītan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*bītaną||bite}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bʰeyd-||split}}. 

Cognates include {{cog|stq|biete||bite}}, {{cog|fy|bite||bite}}, {{cog|nl|bijten||bite}}, {{cog|nds-de|bieten||bite}}, {{cog|de|beißen}}, {{m|de|beissen||bite}}, {{cog|da|bide||bite}}, {{cog|sv|bita||bite}}, {{cog|nb|bite||bite}}, {{cog|nn|bita||bite}}, {{cog|is|bíta||bite}}, {{cog|got|𐌱𐌴𐌹𐍄𐌰𐌽||bite}}, {{cog|la|findō||split}}, {{cog|grc|φείδομαι}}, {{cog|sa|भिद्||break}}.

